      <title>ZCode 3.0 与 Claude Code：AI 代理编码架构的两种路径</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260901/ZCode-3.0-%E4%B8%8E-Claude-CodeAI-%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84/</link>
